  ('2119fe91-129b-5168-a6b2-a120a889bad8', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-precise-language'), null, 'medium',
   $q$A report found that a new irrigation schedule cut a vineyard's water use by 30 percent. A draft says: "The report says that the new irrigation schedule helped the vineyard." Which revision is the most precise?$q$, $q$[{"text":"The report shows that the new irrigation schedule cut the vineyard's water use by 30 percent.","is_correct":true},{"text":"The report shows that the new irrigation schedule doubled the vineyard's grape harvest.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-new-fact"},{"text":"The report says that the new irrigation schedule helped the vineyard a whole lot.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"informal-word"},{"text":"The report says the new irrigation schedule affected the vineyard's water use in various ways.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"vague-wording"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$The report shows that the new irrigation schedule cut the vineyard's water use by 30 percent.$q$, $q$The correct revision replaces the vague "helped" with the specific result stated in the report. The harvest choice sounds precise, but the report says nothing about the grape harvest.$q$, 'draft', null)
