  ('b2a24167-f1da-5968-adca-345c36236a34', null, (select id from public.skills where slug = 'write-g12-writing-with-evidence'), null, 'medium',
   $q$Which revision of sentence 11 best concludes the draft?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Taken together, Mthembu's numbers show that pace groups help first-timers finish by teaching them to save energy early.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Taken together, Mthembu's numbers show that the Harlow City Marathon is the best race in the region.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"unsupported-inference"},{"text":"Taken together, Mthembu's numbers show that 89 percent of first-time entrants finished after 2018.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"evidence-without-analysis"},{"text":"Taken together, Mthembu's numbers show that every runner should join a pace group in every race.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Taken together, Mthembu's numbers show that pace groups help first-timers finish by teaching them to save energy early.$q$, $q$The correct conclusion restates the claim and links it to the split times and finishing rates. The "every runner" version stretches findings about first-time marathoners into a rule for all runners and races.$q$, 'draft', '8fa8f357-fefe-5276-8bda-5e42f95a881d')
